{"method":{"methodHash":"0550a42d09aa3e16dec449c9d697b989","typeHash":"2ca9d5d2b01a9292fa204f5df7b8e46f","name":"Distance","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/MathUtil.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":20,"startColumn":9,"endLine":26,"endColumn":10},"calls":[]},"lines":["        [MethodImpl(MethodImplOptions.AggressiveInlining)]","        public static float Distance(Prediction a, Prediction b)","        {","            float dx = a.ScreenCenterX - b.ScreenCenterX;","            float dy = a.ScreenCenterY - b.ScreenCenterY;","            return dx * dx \u002B dy * dy;","        }"],"startLine":20}